message: >-
  If you use SGAEIA in your research, publications, teaching, or technical
  projects, please cite the software using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "SGAEIA: Secure Governed Autonomous Edge Intelligence Architecture"
abstract: >-
  SGAEIA is an open and vendor-neutral reference architecture and
  Spec-Driven Development framework for governed autonomous intelligence
  across Cloud, MEC, Edge, IoT, OT, and cyber-physical environments.
  It combines workload identity, bounded capabilities and delegation,
  risk-adaptive autonomy, policy enforcement, continuous GRC,
  evidence-as-code, formal security invariants, and adapter conformance.
